      <p source="#source-637-648"><seg source="#source-637-648">●目次</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-648-685"><seg source="#source-648-685">◆未収録詩篇（1936～1940）</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-685-699"><seg source="#source-685-699">性別の谷</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-699-734"><seg source="#source-699-734">一つの太陽と二つの現実</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-734-745"><seg source="#source-734-745">パドマ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-745-774"><seg source="#source-745-774">雪の伝説を探るには</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-774-791"><seg source="#source-774-791">右手と左手</seg></p>
