      <p source="#source-1755-1775"><seg source="#source-1755-1775">女流諷刺詩篇</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1775-1792"><seg source="#source-1775-1792">太田洋子</seg></p>
