      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1880-1897"><seg source="#source-1880-1897">水戸光子</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1897-1914"><seg source="#source-1897-1914">森　赫子</seg></p>
